great about going at life,

00:08:54.824 --> 00:08:57.573
versus being miserable, and
going to a job you hate,

00:08:57.573 --> 00:08:59.519
or living a life that doesn't empower you,

00:08:59.519 --> 00:09:01.710
and just every day moving
through just almost

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:04.558
