really having the zest,

00:09:04.558 --> 00:09:06.832
and the grit, and the greatness of life.

00:09:06.832 --> 00:09:09.837
I'm guilty, I've been there
myself, when I felt like

00:09:09.837 --> 00:09:12.364
I didn't really have a compelling
vision for my own future,

00:09:12.364 --> 00:09:14.076
and I felt like I was wallowing.

00:09:14.076 --> 00:09:16.002
But at least I'm conscious of that.

00:09:16.002 --> 00:09:18.206
Once you become conscious of that,

00:09:18.206 --> 00:09:21.062
you can consciously create
a vision for your future.

00:09:21.062 --> 00:09:23.787
It doesn't happen in
one minute, or an hour.

00:09:23.787 --> 00:09:25.503
You write it down, you work on it.

00:09:25.503 --> 00:09:27.723
And when you finally hit on it,

00:09:27.723 --> 00:09:29.077
you know how you know you got it?

00:09:29.077 --> 00:09:31.757
When you read it back to
yourself, your vision statement,

00:09:31.757 --> 00:09:34.484
and it moves you, and you feel inspired.

00:09:34.484 --> 00:09:37.030
Okay, and so few people have that.

00:09:37.030 --> 00:09:39.846
And what happens is every human being

00:09:39.846 --> 00:09:41.466
is thirsty for a vision.

00:09:41.466 --> 00:09:42.577
Everyone is.

00:09:42.577 --> 00:09:43.627
And so few people have it.

00:09:43.627 --> 00:09:45.916
And so what they do, they
gravitate toward someone

00:09:45.916 --> 00:09:47.316
who has a vision for the future,

00:09:47.316 --> 00:09:49.125
'cause they want to be a part of a vision.

00:09:49.125 --> 00:09:52.940
Part of being a great entrepreneur
is having that vision,

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:54.500
being able to create the vision,

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:57.367
and then sell that vision to other people.

00:09:57.367 --> 00:09:59.848
To get them to want to be
inspired, to buy into it.

00:09:59.848 --> 00:10:02.261
To put in their time, their
hard work, their elbow grease,

00:10:02.261 --> 00:10:04.265
to help you achieve your vision.

00:10:04.265 --> 00:10:06.134
If you're a smart one, then
you spread the wealth around,

00:10:06.134 --> 00:10:08.559
and it's a win-win for everybody.

00:10:08.559 --> 00:10:10.976
The only thing that stops you

00:10:11.838 --> 00:10:13.688
from getting what you want in life

00:10:13.688 --> 00:10:17.174
is the bull (bleep)
story you tell yourself

00:10:17.174 --> 00:10:19.462
of why you can't have it.

00:10:19.462 --> 00:10:20.295
You get that?

00:10:20.295 --> 00:10:22.272
What stops you back is the story,

00:10:22.272 --> 00:10:24.820
because the story stops
you from getting honest.

00:10:24.820 --> 00:10:27.474
And if you can't get honest with yourself,

00:10:27.474 --> 00:10:28.314
there's nowhere you can go.

00:10:28.314 --> 00:10:30.935
Imagine like this,
success in sales and life,

00:10:30.935 --> 00:10:32.676
it's like a road map, right?

00:10:32.676 --> 00:10:35.168
You know where you want to go,

00:10:35.168 --> 00:10:36.642
and you have this perfect strategy

00:10:36.642 --> 00:10:38.140
with a straight line to get there.

00:10:38.140 --> 00:10:39.202
It's a perfect strategy.

00:10:39.202 --> 00:10:41.773
It's going to get you
there every single time.

00:10:41.773 --> 00:10:43.387
But if you don't know your starting point,

00:10:43.387 --> 00:10:46.295
if you're not getting honest
with where you actually are,

00:10:46.295 --> 00:10:49.009
it doesn't matter how
powerful the strategy is,

00:10:49.009 --> 00:10:50.715
and it doesn't matter how
powerful your goal is.

00:10:50.715 --> 00:10:52.511
I'm going to ask you to
set a goal today, right?

00:10:52.511 --> 00:10:53.779
A 60 day goal.

00:10:53.779 --> 00:10:55.317
And let's say you really set this goal,

00:10:55.317 --> 00:10:57.294
and I'll show you how to
do it in a brilliant way,

00:10:57.294 --> 00:10:59.791
so it's visceral, so it
makes you really feel it,

00:10:59.791 --> 00:11:02.443
you see it, you sense
it, you smell the goal.

00:11:02.443 --> 00:11:03.821
That's step one.

00:11:03.821 --> 00:11:05.921
I'm going to teach you the straight line,

00:11:05.921 --> 00:11:09.491
which is your strategy
to get to your goal.

00:11:09.491 --> 00:11:13.049
But if you're not honest
with where you are right now,

00:11:13.049 --> 00:11:16.549
your starting point, the map is worthless.

00:11:17.932 --> 00:11:19.973
There's three things
that you need to know.

00:11:19.973 --> 00:11:23.796
Where you are, where you want to go,

00:11:23.796 --> 00:11:25.763
and how you're going to get there.

00:11:25.763 --> 00:11:28.168
Those are the three things you must have

00:11:28.168 --> 00:11:31.398
to take advantage of any opportunity.

00:11:31.398 --> 00:11:32.722
I'm going to give you the strategy.

00:11:32.722 --> 00:11:34.314
I'm going to ask you to tell me exactly

00:11:34.314 --> 00:11:37.231
where you want to go, for yourself.

00:11:38.387 --> 00:11:39.311
You got to get honest.

00:11:39.311 --> 00:11:41.314
Don't blame the boss,
don't blame the leagues,

00:11:41.314 --> 00:11:43.964
don't blame your job, don't
blame the industry you're in.

00:11:43.964 --> 00:11:44.797
Just get honest.

00:11:44.797 --> 00:11:47.011
If you don't like your
industry, find another one.

00:11:47.011 --> 00:11:47.969
My message is this.

00:11:47.969 --> 00:11:51.540
There's only one way to
get rich, and that's quick.

00:11:51.540 --> 00:11:53.611
That's not a get rich
quick scheme, though.

00:11:53.611 --> 00:11:55.570
Because the world's too
expensive to get rich slowly.

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:57.453
But what I mean by getting rich quick

00:11:57.453 --> 00:11:59.351
is that there are certain
things you have to know.

00:11:59.351 --> 00:12:01.333
On the inner game of wealth,

00:12:01.333 --> 00:12:02.631
how you manage your emotional state,

00:12:02.631 --> 00:12:05.026
your beliefs, your standards, your focus.

00:12:05.026 --> 00:12:08.508
Then on the outer game,
entrepreneurship, sales, marketing,

00:12:08.508 --> 00:12:11.055
how to develop multiple streams of income.

00:12:11.055 --> 00:12:12.098
It takes time.

00:12:12.098 --> 00:12:13.788
That's where the hard work,
'cause a lot of hard work

00:12:13.788 --> 00:12:15.763
goes into getting this
lined up, and that lined up.

00:12:15.763 --> 00:12:18.199
But once you have it all lined
up and you've done the work,

00:12:18.199 --> 00:12:21.093
then you can make money
very, very quickly.

00:12:21.093 --> 00:12:23.354
So it's not a scheme, but
you got to get rich quick,

00:12:23.354 --> 00:12:24.765
and you have to put the work in.

00:12:24.765 --> 00:12:26.849
I say, if you don't want
to work hard, good luck.

00:12:26.849 --> 00:12:28.133
I don't know any rich people

00:12:28.133 --> 00:12:29.181
that don't work really, really hard.

00:12:29.181 --> 00:12:30.030
- Right, right, right.

00:12:30.030 --> 00:12:30.863
- That's the bottom line.

00:12:30.863 --> 00:12:32.758
So hard work and knowing stuff, skills.

00:12:32.758 --> 00:12:34.282
- [Interviewer] There's
no quick fix, easy fix.

00:12:34.282 --> 00:12:37.287
- No, again, when you get
rich, it happens quickly,

00:12:37.287 --> 00:12:38.989
but there's a lot of work
that goes up to that point.

00:12:38.989 --> 00:12:39.845
- [Interviewer] Goes into it, yes.

00:12:39.845 --> 00:12:41.354
- Before the money starts pouring in.

00:12:41.354 --> 00:12:43.227
That's the distinction that
I think a lot of people

00:12:43.227 --> 00:12:44.793
who are not wealthy, they don't get that.

00:12:44.793 --> 00:12:47.280
They think that you accumulate
money a little bit at a time,

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:48.523
it doesn't work that way.

00:12:48.523 --> 00:12:51.138
You work, work, work, work,
don't get the result, bam,

00:12:51.138 --> 00:12:52.851
one last piece of the puzzle clicks in,

00:12:52.851 --> 00:12:53.684
whether it's not knowing how to close.

00:12:53.684 --> 00:12:54.517
- [Interviewer] And it all happens.

00:12:54.517 --> 00:12:55.537
- And it all happens quickly.

00:12:55.537 --> 00:12:58.706
Also, to really take a longer term view.

00:12:58.706 --> 00:13:00.689
Not just to look three months from now,

00:13:00.689 --> 00:13:01.858
but look three years from now.

00:13:01.858 --> 00:13:04.380
And the future's going to come,
whether you like it or not,

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:06.860
so you want to kind of be one step ahead.

00:13:06.860 --> 00:13:08.788
- It's a mind game, then?

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:11.552
- Well, I think it's psychology.

00:13:11.552 --> 00:13:13.206
Everything, again life, most of life,

00:13:13.206 --> 00:13:15.016
comes down to psychology, doesn't it?

00:13:15.016 --> 00:13:17.232
It starts here, in the internal world.

00:13:17.232 --> 00:13:19.350
Before you can master the external world,

00:13:19.350 --> 00:13:21.439
you have to master your
own internal world.

00:13:21.439 --> 00:13:24.044
That's the true secret to success.

00:13:24.044 --> 00:13:25.911
My son's 14, he's fabulous.

00:13:25.911 --> 00:13:29.022
And we're having this conversation

00:13:29.022 --> 00:13:32.218
about when he plays in sports,
or when he does something,

00:13:32.218 --> 00:13:34.583
about do you go full out, or do you not.

00:13:34.583 --> 00:13:38.441
And I see sometimes in him
that when he's out on the field

00:13:38.441 --> 00:13:41.111
or doing something, he
doesn't play full out,

00:13:41.111 --> 00:13:43.258
and will have an excuse.

00:13:43.258 --> 00:13:46.229
Like, "My leg hurts," or "My arm hurts."

00:13:46.229 --> 00:13:48.925
Or something happened,
the coach was unfair,

00:13:48.925 --> 00:13:51.137
the referee was unfair.

00:13:51.137 --> 00:13:53.190
And what happens with people

00:13:53.190 --> 00:13:54.878
is we tend to go out into the world

00:13:54.878 --> 00:13:56.849
and we look for those sort of excuses

00:13:56.849 --> 00:14:00.526
about why things aren't
the way we want them.

00:14:00.526 --> 00:14:04.961
And when you do that, you
lose all your power in life.

00:14:04.961 --> 00:14:06.371
When you start focusing on the external,

00:14:06.371 --> 00:14:08.421
on the excuses, you lose your power.

00:14:08.421 --> 00:14:10.028
Here's the way people really think.

00:14:10.028 --> 00:14:14.061
I will tell ya, I can go
out onto stage and bomb.

00:14:14.061 --> 00:14:16.141
You go out there, and
you just bomb, right?

00:14:16.141 --> 00:14:18.987
And people will respect
you for going out there

00:14:18.987 --> 00:14:21.056
and trying your hardest.

00:14:21.056 --> 00:14:23.344
It's not how you actually perform

00:14:23.344 --> 00:14:25.572
that earns you the respect of your peers.

00:14:25.572 --> 00:14:28.638
It's the fact that you went
out and actually did it.

00:14:28.638 --> 00:14:30.126
That's the difference.

00:14:30.126 --> 00:14:31.299
So if you're out there right now,

00:14:31.299 --> 00:14:32.415
and you're a new salesperson,

00:14:32.415 --> 00:14:35.188
or you're struggling as a salesperson,

00:14:35.188 --> 00:14:38.505
there's no embarrassment in struggle.

00:14:38.505 --> 00:14:39.858
There's just not.

00:14:39.858 --> 00:14:42.289
The embarrassment is in quitting.

00:14:42.289 --> 00:14:45.540
The embarrassment is in
not trying your hardest.

00:14:45.540 --> 00:14:50.443
Poor people believe they are
creatures of circumstance.

00:14:50.443 --> 00:14:53.526
That means that life happens to them.

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:56.811
You get that?

00:14:56.811 --> 00:15:00.728
While rich people are
creators of circumstance.

00:15:04.611 --> 00:15:05.444
I will tell you this.

00:15:05.444 --> 00:15:08.239
There is no more destructive
belief in the world

00:15:08.239 --> 00:15:11.293
than to think that life happens to you.

00:15:11.293 --> 00:15:13.939
'Cause there's three things that you do

00:15:13.939 --> 00:15:15.888
when you don't think you
can create your own destiny.

00:15:15.888 --> 00:15:19.414
I'll tell you exactly
what they are, ready?

00:15:19.414 --> 00:15:20.940
Number one.

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.272
The first thing you do is you play

00:15:22.272 --> 00:15:24.522
what I call the blame game.

00:15:25.634 --> 00:15:27.128
You start blaming everybody

00:15:27.128 --> 00:15:29.174
for why you don't have what you want.

00:15:29.174 --> 00:15:31.252
You'll blame the government,
you'll blame your family,

00:15:31.252 --> 00:15:34.170
you'll blame your spouse,
you'll blame your boss,

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:35.867
you'll blame the economy,
you'll blame the people

00:15:35.867 --> 00:15:38.784
on Wall Street, which
probably deserves some blame.

00:15:38.784 --> 00:15:41.801
But you'll blame anybody and everybody

00:15:41.801 --> 00:15:43.998
when you think the world happens to you.

00:15:43.998 --> 00:15:45.359
You're powerless.

00:15:45.359 --> 00:15:48.692
The second thing you do, is you justify.

00:15:54.642 --> 00:15:58.636
It is because, because the economy stinks.

00:15:58.636 --> 00:16:00.542
It's because people are unfair to me.

00:16:00.542 --> 00:16:03.598
It's because money doesn't
really matter anyway.

00:16:03.598 --> 00:16:05.965
Bull (bleep), you don't know that.

00:16:05.965 --> 00:16:07.368
"I live on love alone," really?

00:16:07.368 --> 00:16:10.258
Go bring that to the bank and
pay the rent, hello, okay?

00:16:10.258 --> 00:16:11.221
I love love, I'm in love,

00:16:11.221 --> 00:16:12.103
I'm with the greatest woman in the world.

00:16:12.103 --> 00:16:14.229
I'm going to get married next year.

00:16:14.229 --> 00:16:15.359
For the third time, unfortunately,

00:16:15.359 --> 00:16:17.057
but I'm getting married next year.

00:16:17.057 --> 00:16:18.808
Great woman.

00:16:18.808 --> 00:16:20.478
So I know that money's money, right?

00:16:20.478 --> 00:16:21.427
They justify.

00:16:21.427 --> 00:16:22.816
Third.

00:16:22.816 --> 00:16:24.919
This is the worst one of all.

00:16:24.919 --> 00:16:28.925
So write it down in big
letters, they complain.

00:16:28.925 --> 00:16:31.171
I hate these people, you know why?

00:16:31.171 --> 00:16:32.671
I'll tell you why.

00:16:33.938 --> 00:16:37.041
'Cause I do believe in some
laws of the universe, I do.

00:16:37.041 --> 00:16:39.892
And one of them is that what you focus on

00:16:39.892 --> 00:16:42.004
expands, gets bigger.

00:16:42.004 --> 00:16:45.475
And what you focus on, you attract,

00:16:45.475 --> 00:16:46.912
because you move towards it.

00:16:46.912 --> 00:16:48.352
You're focusing on something, you attract.

00:16:48.352 --> 00:16:49.622
So here's what happens.

00:16:49.622 --> 00:16:53.129
When you're complaining,
what are you focusing on?

00:16:53.129 --> 00:16:55.502
All the (bleep) in your life.

00:16:55.502 --> 00:16:57.658
So guess what happens to you?

00:16:57.658 --> 00:16:59.957
You become a giant (bleep) magnet.

00:16:59.957 --> 00:17:02.846
(audience laughs)

00:17:02.846 --> 00:17:04.131
Get the picture?

00:17:04.131 --> 00:17:04.964
I don't want to be around

00:17:04.964 --> 00:17:06.011
because they attract it to you.

00:17:06.011 --> 00:17:06.844
You got to get away from them.

00:17:06.844 --> 00:17:07.713
Because when you hear some complaining,

00:17:07.713 --> 00:17:08.655
it might hit you too,

00:17:08.655 --> 00:17:10.106
and it's the worst of all.

00:17:10.106 --> 00:17:11.088
That's what complaining does.

00:17:11.088 --> 00:17:13.699
So if you're a person that believes

00:17:13.699 --> 00:17:15.604
that you're a creature of circumstance,

00:17:15.604 --> 00:17:17.861
life happens to you, good luck.

